\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">100</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Mantle\"><img alt=\"Terra Mantle\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Mantle_37c3e3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terra Boots\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Boots_d9273f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Amulet\"><img alt=\"Terra Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Amulet_a43d31.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Silk\"><img alt=\"Spider Silk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_c6e732.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Exotic Spiders Cave\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"105\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exotic_Spiders_Cave_06a6aa.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Exotic Cave Spider Cave 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"91\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exotic_Cave_Spider_Cave_1_cb3ae1.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.60.10463<br/>November 30, 2020<br/>Winter Update 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Exotic Cave</b> (officially known as <i>Trail to Rascacoon</i>) connects <a href=\"#/wiki/Issavi\">Issavi</a> to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pirat%20Mine\">Pirat Mine</a> under <a href=\"#/wiki/Rascacoon\">Rascacoon</a>. The cave is two floors with <a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\">Exotic Cave Spiders</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Bat\">Exotic Bats</a> spawning all over the place.\n</p><p>To gain access, you must gain 1500 points of reputation from <a href=\"#/wiki/Eustacio\">Eustacio</a> by completing the <b>Pirat Raids</b> (A Pirate's Tail quest).\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\"><img alt=\"Exotic Cave Spider\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exotic_Cave_Spider_9b5f3f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Cave%20Spider\">Exotic Cave Spider</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,400</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">420</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Arrow\">Poison Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Terra Boots (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Amulet\">Silver Amulet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Silk\">Spider Silk</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Mantle\">Terra Mantle</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Bat\"><img alt=\"Exotic Bat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Exotic_Bat_10b86d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Exotic%20Bat\">Exotic Bat</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">1,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,500</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Amulet\">Terra Amulet</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-6× <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Mushroom\">Dark Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Mushroom\">Green Mushroom</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1× <a href=\"#/wiki/Garlic%20Necklace\">Garlic Necklace</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Bat%20Wing\">Bat Wing</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1× Exotic Bat Soul Core</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":[]}